OL,3,A'A giant leap forward': Nasa launches
OL,4,Apowerful new space telescope to explore
OL,5,Amysteries of the Universe
OL,6,
OL,7,FNasa's powerful next-generation
OL,8,Ftelescope has blasted off into space
OL,9,Ffrom its launchpad in Florida, with a
OL,10,Fmission to explore dark energy, black
OL,11,Fholes and other mysteries of the
OL,12,FUniverse.
OL,14,FThe Nancy Grace Roman telescope will
OL,15,Fcapture vast panoramic views of space,
OL,16,Fwith a field of vision 100 times larger
OL,17,Fthan both the Hubble and James Webb
OL,18,Fspace telescopes, Nasa says.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
