OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'A giant leap forward': Nasa launches
OL,4,Apowerful new space telescope to explore
OL,5,Amysteries of the Universe
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mission begins with a 100-day
OL,8,Fjourney to a vantage point roughly one
OL,9,Fmillion miles from Earth, where the
OL,10,Ftelescope will then start charting
OL,11,Fplanets outside our solar system, known
OL,12,Fas exoplanets.
OL,14,F"Roman is going to change the way we
OL,15,Flook at the Universe," said Nicky Fox,
OL,16,Fa Nasa administrator.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
